WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.399
Two gears mesh. Rotation crosses the contact point.

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:05.799
More teeth on the output means lower speed.

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:09.000
Here, three to one trades speed for ideal torque.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The real gearbox adds more ratios and losses. Source: Ciechanowski, Gears.
